    steps:['Pour exactly the same amount of water (for example, 50 ml) into each saucer.','Put them in 4 different places: somewhere sunny, somewhere dark and cool, in front of a fan, and outside.','Predict which will dry up first, and write down why.','Check them every day. Measure what is left by pouring it back into the jug.','Record your results in a table and draw a bar chart.'],
